{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2021-04-11 14:00:00', 'title': 'LILLY PRESENTS NEW DATA ON RETEVMO® (SELPERCATINIB) IN ADVANCED RET FUSION-POSITIVE GASTROINTESTINAL AND OTHER CANCERS AT 2021 AMERICAN ASSOCIATION FOR CANCER RESEARCH (AACR) ANNUAL MEETING', 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS, APRIL 11, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE: LLY) TODAY ANNOUNCED FOR THE FIRST TIME DATA FROM THE PHASE 1/2 LIBRETTO-001 TRIAL SHOWING TREATMENT WITH RETEVMO® (SELPERCATINIB) DEMONSTRATED ENCOURAGING ANTITUMOR ACTIVITY AND SAFETY ACROSS RET FUSION-POSITIVE ADVANCED SOLID TUMORS BEYOND LUNG AND THYROID CANCERS, INCLUDING MULTIPLE TREATMENT-REFRACTORY GASTROINTESTINAL (GI) MALIGNANCIES. THE DATA WERE PRESENTED AT THE 2021 AMERICAN ASSOCIATION FOR CANCER RESEARCH (AACR) ANNUAL MEETING, HELD VIRTUALLY APRIL 10-15, 2021.'}